        "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to choose a PC within Far range. The target must make an Presence Reaction Roll (19). On a success, they mark a Stress. On a failure, they mark a HP and activate a Doom Countdown (4). It ticks down when the @Lookup[@name] is spotlighted. When it triggers, the target makes a death move. If the @Lookup[@name] is defeated or the PCs take a rest, all Doom Countdowns end.</p>",
